  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "The hospital admits **55 patients per day**. Since there are **7 days in a week**:\n\n\\[\n55 \\times 7 = 385\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the hospital can admit\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{385\\text{ patients per week}}\n\\]",
    "At **50 patients per day** over **7 days**:\n\n\\[\n50 \\times 7 = 350\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{350\\text{ patients per week}}\n\\]",
